          "heading": "Fiji pitch pride over money in bid to lure Mark Nawaqanitawase",
          "body": "Fiji are pitching pride over money in their bid to lure Mark Nawaqanitawase, according to Reuters. Planet Rugby reports that Fiji have broken their silence on the player's possible shock defection. The pitch came the day before Jake White's first Test in charge, a 34-28 win over Japan in Tokyo, and ahead of November's Nations Championship games against France, Ireland and Italy."
