          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Shannon Frizell, Tyrel Lomax and Samisoni Taukei’aho ruled out of Europe tour",
          "body": "Frizell ruptured the posterior cruciate ligament in his left knee and faces six weeks out, while Taukei’aho is expected to miss four to six weeks with a torn calf muscle. Prop Lomax, troubled by a neck disc injury since Super Rugby, will stay in New Zealand for treatment. The trio were ruled out after the second Bledisloe Cup Test in Sydney; Richie Mo’unga, who missed both Bledisloe Tests with a calf tear, is not yet ruled out of the tour, SA Rugby Magazine reports."
        },
